{% comment %}
  Purelane price block with a stable structure the tests and the sections rely
  on: .pr > .price, .compare, .discount. Named pl-price so it sits alongside the
  base theme's own price snippet rather than replacing it.

  One implementation, reused by the product card, the combo tray and the bundle
  tiers. The discount percentage is always computed from the two prices, never
  typed. Prices are formatted with the money filter and the shop currency.

  Accepts:
    price       - amount in the shop's minor units (required)
    compare_at  - compare-at amount; a strikethrough and discount show when it
                  is greater than price (optional)
    show_discount - show the computed percentage chip (default true)
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign compare_at = compare_at | default: 0
  if show_discount == nil
    assign show_discount = true
  endif
-%}
<div class="pr">
  <span class="price">{{ price | money }}</span>
  {%- if compare_at > price and compare_at > 0 -%}
    <s class="compare">{{ compare_at | money }}</s>
    {%- if show_discount -%}
      {%- assign pct = compare_at | minus: price | times: 100 | divided_by: compare_at -%}
      <span class="discount">{{ 'products.percent_off' | t: percent: pct }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
